        "PMC7475834::chunk::000::abstract::d1ff4579e4"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pre-oxidation forms a continuous, adherent, copper-enriched oxide or spinel-rich glaze on FeNiCrCoCu.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pre-formed oxide glaze acts as a protective barrier during sliding contact.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7475834::chunk::000::abstract::d1ff4579e4"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide glaze reduces direct metal-to-metal contact.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide glaze limits further oxidation of the coating.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7475834::chunk::000::abstract::d1ff4579e4"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Copper segregation within the oxide may improve glaze integrity and adhesion under sliding loads.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The barrier mechanism decreases friction during high-temperature sliding.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The barrier mechanism decreases mechanical wear during high-temperature sliding.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to the as-deposited control, the pre-oxidized coating will have a lower coefficient of friction.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to the as-deposited control, the pre-oxidized coating will have reduced wear-track depth.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to the as-deposited control, the pre-oxidized coating will have lower overall mass loss.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
